.TH CHTTPCLIENT_RESP_HEADER 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
chttpclient_resp_header \- look up a response header by name
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <chttpclient.h>

const char *chttpclient_resp_header(const chttpcli_response *resp,
                                    const char *name);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Returns the value of the named response header, or NULL if not present.
The lookup is case-insensitive.  Response headers are stored in
lowercase; the supplied name is lowercased internally before lookup.

The returned pointer is valid until chttpclient_resp_free is called.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
resp  Response to query; may be NULL (returns NULL).
name  Header name; may be NULL (returns NULL).
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
Pointer to the header value string, or NULL if not found.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR chttpclient_resp_free (3)
